>In </span><span begin="01:36.320" end="01:37.250">Sickness</span><span begin="01:37.250" end="01:37.280">, </span><span begin="01:37.280" end="01:37.700">No </span><span begin="01:37.700" end="01:38.180">Vows </span><span begin="01:38.180" end="01:38.720">Mean </span><span begin="01:38.720" end="01:39.530">Anything</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.530" end="01:43.070"><span begin="01:39.530" end="01:39.950">So </span><span begin="01:39.950" end="01:41.060">Long </span><span begin="01:41.090" end="01:41.960">Cruelty</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.070" end="01:46.730"><span begin="01:43.070" end="01:43.550">So </span><span begin="01:43.550" end="01:44.360">Long</span><span begin="01:44.360" end="01:44.930">, </span><span begin="01:44.930" end="01:45.410">Too </span><span begin="01:45.410" end="01:46.610">Late</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.730" end="01:49.970"><span begin="01:46.730" end="01:47.150">So </span><span begin="01:47.150" end="01:48.320">Long</span><span begin="01:48.320" end="01:48.500">, </span><span begin="01:48.500" end="01:48.980">My </span><span begin="01:48.980" end="01:49.970">Love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.970" end="02:27.830"><span begin="01:49.970" end="01:50.750">Is </span><span begin="01:50.750" end="01:52.010">Dead</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:27.830" end="02:34.400"><span begin="02:27.830" end="02:28.010">Is </span><span begin="02:28.010" end="02:28.280">There </span><span begin="02:28.280" end="02:29.120">Nothing </span><span begin="02:29.120" end="02:29.480">You </span><span begin="02:29.480" end="02:30.470">Cannot </span><span begin="02:30.470" end="02:32.960">Replace</span><span begin="02:32.960" end="02:34.400">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.400" end="02:41.120"><span begin="02:34.400" end="02:34.580">You </span><span begin="02:34.580" end="02:35.120">Speak </span><span begin="02:35.120" end="02:36.080">Lioness </span><span begin="02:36.080" end="02:36.380">And </span><span